"počinje i završava (možete pogledati pravila pritiskom \"objasni DST pravila"
"\" dugme u geografskom položaju prozora)."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (UseAnimatedSlewing), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:237
msgid "Use animated slewing effects when changing focus position?"
msgstr "Koristite animirane Okret oko ose efekte pri promeni položaja fokusa?"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseAnimatedSlewing), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:238
msgid ""
"If true, focus changes will cause the sky to visibly spin to the new "
"position.  Otherwise, the display will \"snap\" instantly to the new "
"position."
msgstr ""
"Ako je to tačno, promjena fokusa će  prouzrokovati da se nebo okreće "
"vidljivo na novi položaj. U suprotnom,  prikaz će  se\"zalijepiti\", odmah "
"na novi položaj."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FOVNames), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:242
msgid "Name of selected FOV indicators"
msgstr "Naziv odabranih FOV indikatora"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (FOVNames), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:243
msgid ""
"The names of the currently selected field-of-view indicators.  The list of "
"defined FOV indicator names is listed in the \"Settings|FOV Symbols\" menu."
msgstr ""
"Imena trenutno odabranih polja gledanja indikatora. Lista indikatora "
"definisanih FOV imena navedena u \"Podešavanja | FOV simboli\" meniju."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FadePlanetTrails), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:246
msgid "Fade planet trails to background color?"
msgstr "Izbledjeli tragovi planeta na boju pozadine?"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (FadePlanetTrails), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:247
msgid ""
"If true, trails attached to solar system bodies will fade into the "
"background sky color."
msgstr ""
"Ako je tačno, tragovi vezani za tijela sunčevog sistema će izblijedjeti u "
"boju pozadine neba."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FocusRA), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:251
msgid "Right Ascension of focus position"
msgstr "Rektascenzija pozicije fokusa"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (FocusRA), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:252
msgid ""
"The right ascension of the initial focus position of the sky map, in decimal "
"hours.  This value is volatile; it is reset whenever the program shuts down."
msgstr ""
"Rektascenzija od inicijalne pozicije fokusa nebeske karte, u decimalnim "
"satima. Ova vrijednost je promjenjljiva, ona se resetuje svaki put kada "
"program isključi."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FocusDec), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:256
msgid "Declination of focus position"
msgstr "Deklinacija pozicije fokusa"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (FocusDec), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:257
msgid ""
"The declination of the initial focus position of the sky map, in decimal "
"degrees.  This value is volatile; it is reset whenever the program shuts "
"down."
msgstr ""
"Deklinacija od inicijalne pozicije fokusa karte neba, u decimalnim "
"stepenima. Ova vrijednost je promjenjljiva, ona se resetuje svaki put kada "
"program isključi."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FocusObject), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:261
msgid "Name of focused object"
msgstr "Naziv fokusiranog objekta"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (FocusObject), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:262
msgid ""
"The name of the object that should be centered and tracked on startup.  If "
"no object should be centered, set to \"nothing\".  This value is volatile; "
"it is reset whenever the program shuts down."
msgstr ""
"Naziv objekta koji treba da bude centriran i praćen prilikom pokretanja "
"programa. Ako nijedan objekat ne bi trebalo da bude centriran, postavi na "
"\"ništa\". Ova vrijednost je promjenjljiva, ona se resetuje svaki put kada "
"se program isključi."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (IsTracking), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:266
msgid "Is tracking engaged?"
msgstr "Da li se obavlja praćenje?"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (IsTracking), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:267
msgid ""
"True if the skymap should track on its initial position on startup.  This "
"value is volatile; it is reset whenever the program shuts down."
msgstr ""
"Tačno ako treba skymap pratiti početnu poziciju prilikom pokretanja "
"programa. Ova vrednost je nestabilna, ona se resetuje svaki put kada program "
"isključi."

